+```bash
+PACKAGE=com.kumpas.kumpas_app
+adb -s "$SERIAL" shell run-as "$PACKAGE" mkdir -p files/benchmarks
+adb -s "$SERIAL" shell "run-as $PACKAGE sh -c 'cat > files/benchmarks/next_setup.json.new'" < /path/to/verified-setup.json
